1. Re-engineer the First 3 Seconds with High-Stakes Hooks
Transition away from casual storytelling intros to immediate value propositions. For the next 7 days, script the opening line using either a direct replacement hook ("Stop using X, use this free tool instead") or an immediate utility promise ("How to build a complete sales funnel in 60 seconds using AI").

2. Publish 100% Reels During Peak IST Window (6:00 PM - 9:00 PM)
Eliminate static image posts entirely for the upcoming week. Schedule all video content exclusively between 6:00 PM and 9:00 PM IST to capitalize on peak audience activity, maximizing the 315 average like baseline for video content.

