With an industry-leading engagement rate of 28.87% driven by comment volume, implement an explicit call-to-action in every Reel: "Comment 'PROMPT' to get my exact Claude/Emergent blueprint." Pair this with automated DM fulfillment to convert comment engagement directly into audience retention and follower growth.
